    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Well known former licenced premises in a prime location overlooking the River Barrow. The property once boasted a thriving food and beverage trade as well as providing Guest House accommodation. The property has been closed for a number of years and is in need of substantial upgrading and refurbishment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Situate in the bustling tourist location of Graiguenamanagh in the picturesque Barrow valley. The town is a centre for all outdoor pursuits, whether walking nearby Mount Brandon or kayaking or swimming in the Barrow.  The property is situate beside The Hub, a popular riverside campground, which enjoys year round occupation, particularly at weekends. \r\nThis property is an ideal investment opportunity in a thriving tourism location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
